ado/pitkin-county"],["PRF calculator","/prf"]],"story":"<p class=\"prf-lede prf-story\">As of Oct 12, the record here runs from 1951 to 2025, and on the middle value of the county&rsquo;s 12 grids September to October came in under 90% of normal in 36 of those 75 years. In 2025, the middle of the grids had November to December at 51% of normal and April to May at 55%. So far in 2026, May to June came in at 44% of normal on the middle of the grids. Grid 23191 had its driest year in 1966 at 63%.</p>"}
